  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Thompson Street satchel slips seamlessly into your workday rotation and weekend plans, thanks to a top handle and an adjustable, removable crossbody strap that let you style it your way. Inside, a center zip divider, middle zip compartment and slip pocket keep essentials sorted. Crafted in pebbled leather, our structured satchel brings a polished finish to any look.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle drop: 4.25&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap Drop: 22&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Middle zip compartment</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Open Top Center Zip Divider</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 13.77&quot; (L) x 8.93&quot; (H) x 5.31&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
